        "Id": "baf15940426346eb846b0adf0932e6cd",
        "Title": "HOW TO USE  -  1st run: leave the file empty -> <project>_SCHEDULES.xlsx is made next to the .rvt with a standard set\nThen Browse... to that Excel.  CREATE = YES per schedule, FIELDS = Revit parameter names, comma separated.  Save + close, Run.\nMissing schedules are created, existing ones only get missing fields added.  AVAILABLE FIELDS tab lists the field names Revit offers.",
